## Scripts

| Command | Description |
| --- | --- |
| `npm run dev` | Dev server (port 5173) |
| `npm run build` | Production build → `dist` |
| `npm run preview` | Preview the production build locally |

---

## Routes

| Path | Page |
| --- | --- |
| `/` | Redirects to `/projects` |
| `/projects` | List (search, filter, pagination) |
| `/projects/:id` | Single project |
| `*` | 404 |

---

## Vercel

- **Build:** `npm run build`
- **Output:** `dist`
- **Monorepo:** set **Root Directory** to `frontend`

`vercel.json` rewrites SPA routes to `index.html`. Set **`VITE_API_BASE_URL`** in Vercel environment variables. Your backend **CORS** must allow the deployed frontend origin.

